msgid "To run the jobs with `EstimatorV2`, get the backend and instantiate `EstimatorV2`. Then transpile the circuit, and apply the layout of the transpiled circuit to the corresponding observables whose expectation values you want to compute. Finally, create PUBs by pairing the transpiled circuit with the corresponding observables, and pass them to the `run` method of `EstimatorV2`.\n"
